rooms_desc ({"The house you have just entered seemed very curious. There are strangepaintings hanging on the walls and hundreds of old relics decorate theshelves. Some of the relics are shining bright providing the hall withwarm light. You wonder how this enormous treasury could have beencollected together in this place. There is a large table in the middle of the room. You caught sight ofa shiny note and the book of thieves laying on the table. Somethingtells you that you should examine them. An open cupboard is standingin the corner.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"This must be the house of Thorm the member of the Armond Clan.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
